Heads up and get us home.


00:26:08.206 --> 00:26:10.029
Good work.


00:26:28.690 --> 00:26:30.074
Taylor, I've got you on speaker.


00:26:30.274 --> 00:26:31.924
<i>We are right behind the Dodge.
Mr. Grey,</i>


00:26:32.124 --> 00:26:33.732
<i>he's still trying to
