00:31:38.851 --> 00:31:39.908
Here.


00:31:46.992 --> 00:31:49.253
Like a river.


00:31:49.953 --> 00:31:51.019
Okay.


00:32:15.162 --> 00:32:19.298
- Good morning, wife
- Good morning, husband.


00:32:21.089 --> 00:32:22.090
I am off.


00:32:25.213 --> 00:32:28.641
Fly safe.
Text me when you land.


00:32:28.676 --> 00:32:30.845
Stay close to
Sawyer and Prescott


00:32:31.214 --> 00:32:33.728
Come straight home after work.


00:32:34.238 --> 00:32:36.306
