00:32:36.632 --> 00:32:38.242
I love you.


00:33:02.444 --> 00:33:03.538
Hi, Mr. Roach.


00:33:03.738 --> 00:33:06.940
Jerry, come on,
Jesus it's Jerry, OK?


00:33:08.863 --> 00:33:12.284
Pre-orders for Boyce Fox,
check that out. Check it out.


00:33:14.128 --> 00:33:15.793
Two hundred thousand?


00:33:15.871 --> 00:33:17.414
That includes the
books and the marketing


00:33:17.614 --> 00:33:19.005
hasn't yet gotten
off the blocks yet.


00:33:19.029 --> 00:33:20.211
Oh, my God.


00:33:20.412 --> 00:33:22.682
You were right
about his readerships.


00:33:22.882 --> 00:33:25.006
That's really just.


00:33:25.267 --> 00:33:27.788
That's good work, really
good work Anna.


00:33:28.883 --> 00:33:30.133
Keep it coming.


00:33:36.708 --> 00:33:39.199
<i>Kate- Hey stranger! Drinks tonight?
I got us a table at the Bunker club!</i>


