00:34:22.140 --> 00:34:24.319
Because Elliott wasn't exaggerating.


00:34:24.616 --> 00:34:25.413
What do you mean?


00:34:25.448 --> 00:34:27.017
He said that Christian
ran security for the


00:34:27.217 --> 00:34:28.787
