- Yeah, I think it does.


00:36:06.846 --> 00:36:09.536
Yeah, except you don't
see enough your friends.


00:36:09.789 --> 00:36:13.067
- I know, I know, I'm sorry.
- I missed your face. Cheers.


00:36:13.102 --> 00:36:14.891
Cheers.


00:36:14.926 --> 00:36:16.909
- To your face.
- To my plans.


00:36:18.321 --> 00:36:21.280
Oh, my God, what is that?


00:36:21.315 --> 00:36:25.394
You know me,
I hate jelly fish.


00:36:25.429 --> 00:36:28.346
And I'm like halfway out of the
water and halfway off the terrain.


00:36:29.040 --> 00:36:31.198
Oh, my God.
You are so cute.


00:36:31.482 --> 00:36:33.376
- I missed you.
- I missed you.


00:36:33.673 --> 00:36:35.841
I'm gonna stalk you until
you make another date OK?


00:36:37.404 --> 00:36:39.004
Oh sorry, my phone.
It's just crazy.


00:36:39.039 --> 00:36:40.519
- It's OK
- Oh Jesus.


00:36:41.699 --> 00:36:44.863
- Come on, we'll give you a ride.
- Okay.


00:36:45.451 --> 00:36:48.533
<i>This is Christian Gray.
Leave a message.</i>


00:36:52.252 --> 00:36:53.283
Sawyer,


00:36:53.318 --> 00:36:57.801
if you speak to my
husband tonight,


00:36:57.836 --> 00:37:01.599
