00:37:05.991 --> 00:37:08.612
I spoke with him
when you got off work.


00:37:12.207 --> 00:37:13.647
Shit.


00:37:43.082 --> 00:37:44.197
Mrs Gray?


00:37:45.911 --> 00:37:48.070
Anna, you are
gonna be a good girl.


00:37:49.060 --> 00:37:51.263
And you will walk to the elevator


00:37:51.618 --> 00:37:55.043
