00:38:12.138 --> 00:38:13.715
Hands on your head.


00:38:13.869 --> 00:38:16.120
Hands on your head or I will fire.


00:38:17.273 --> 00:38:18.525
You okay, Mrs. Gray?


00:38:18.560 --> 00:38:19.881
