00:38:29.447 --> 00:38:33.730
- So, Hyde's a former colleague of yours?
- Ah, yes. He was my boss.


00:38:33.947 --> 00:38:35.224
Until a few weeks ago but,


00:38:35.259 --> 00:38:38.019
