00:38:38.054 --> 00:38:40.506
- Can I ask why?
- Because he attacked me.


00:38:40.542 --> 00:38:43.386
Sir, we recovered this from an elevator


00:38:43.587 --> 00:38:45.444
maintenance vehicle
parked in lower garage.


00:38:46.170 --> 00:38:47.199
Stolen plates,


00:38:47.234 --> 00:38:49.259
must have been how the
suspect gained access.


00:38:51.114 --> 00:38:52.941
This mean anything
to you, Mrs. Gray?


00:38:57.370 --> 00:38:59.130
No, nothing.


00:38:59.370 --> 00:39:02.630
Mr. Grey is on his way home,
we will need to wrap this up.


00:39:02.900 --> 00:39:05.969
We will finish this another time
Mrs. Gray. You rest.


00:39:07.138 --> 00:39:08.825
And uh...


00:39:08.860 --> 00:39:10.900
Don't worry about Hyde, we've
got enough to hold him.


00:39:10.924 --> 00:39:12.270
He won't be going heavy.


00:39:13.346 --> 00:39:14.878
Alright.


00:39:31.114 --> 00:39:32.315
Hi.


00:39:43.396 --> 00:39:44.940
Come to bed.


00:39:57.133 --> 00:39:58.555
Maybe later.


00:40:47.965 --> 00:40:49.357
I can't.


00:41:03.724 --> 00:41:04.947
Anna, hey.


00:41:06.447 --> 00:41:08.666
