Are you okay?


00:41:12.897 --> 00:41:15.647
Must have been terrifying.
Are you sure you should be in work?


00:41:15.682 --> 00:41:17.547
Yes, it was but I'm, I'm...


00:41:17.703 --> 00:41:18.952
I'm fine.


00:41:19.805 --> 00:41:21.126
I'm fine.


00:41:28.456 --> 00:41:31.166
One of the reports said
that it was Jack Hyde.


00:41:32.841 --> 00:41:34.242
It was.


00:41:35.256 --> 00:41:36.624
What did he want?


00:41:36.849 --> 00:41:40.777
Liz, I appreciate your concern
but I don't wanna talk about it.


00:41:43.066 --> 00:41:44.449
Okay.


00:41:44.675 --> 00:41:47.040
I don't know what
I'm gonna tell Mr. Roach.


00:41:48.369 --> 00:41:50.345
