00:41:51.750 --> 00:41:55.433
Whatever you say,
Mrs. Gray.


00:42:05.495 --> 00:42:07.366
Hello?


00:42:14.341 --> 00:42:16.220
Welcome home Anastasia.


00:42:18.088 --> 00:42:19.226
Christian?


00:42:20.029 --> 00:42:21.343
Where's everybody?


00:42:21.540 --> 00:42:22.709
Elsewhere.


00:42:29.070 --> 00:42:31.006
