00:44:19.224 --> 00:44:21.475
That's how you make me feel.


00:44:23.179 --> 00:44:24.603
Christian.


00:44:25.757 --> 00:44:27.613
You promise one thing


00:44:28.390 --> 00:44:30.171
then do the opposite.


00:44:34.901 --> 00:44:36.784
Now you know how that feels.


00:44:37.459 --> 00:44:39.740
