00:44:43.579 --> 00:44:45.672
Frustrating like you.


00:44:45.707 --> 00:44:47.395
Red, red.


00:44:47.430 --> 00:44:50.231
Red, red, red, red!


00:45:12.327 --> 00:45:15.618
That was not love.
Christian, that was revenge.


00:45:15.653 --> 00:45:17.272
You told me you were coming
straight home


00:45:17.307 --> 00:45:19.411
Don't use the red room
to even the score.


00:45:19.446 --> 00:45:20.461
I was scared for you.


00:45:20.661 --> 00:45:23.118
I was safer in that bar
with Kate than I was here.


00:45:24.006 --> 00:45:25.771
I denied you,


00:45:25.806 --> 00:45:27.478
