break your promises.


00:45:29.914 --> 00:45:31.253
You denied me to punish me.


00:45:31.288 --> 00:45:33.863
I felt powerless knowing
that Hyde was out there.


00:45:33.898 --> 00:45:35.951
I was angry,
I was away from home.


00:45:38.729 --> 00:45:41.523
I just wanted to see my friends.


00:45:41.558 --> 00:45:43.474
But Christian, why didn't
you tell me that


00:45:43.674 --> 00:45:45.681
