links to get to us?


00:46:01.442 --> 00:46:03.215
There has to be a reason.


00:46:04.129 --> 00:46:05.685
There is gotta be some connection.


00:46:05.878 --> 00:46:06.937
I know.


00:46:15.472 --> 00:46:17.787
You know, I had a dream last night.


00:46:19.008 --> 00:46:21.955
That you are dead.


00:46:21.990 --> 00:46:24.220
And you are lying on the concrete.


00:46:25.285 --> 00:46:28.988
And you were cold and
I couldn't wake you.


00:46:31.645 --> 00:46:32.830
I'm fine.


00:46:34.446 --> 00:46:36.320
I'm right here, I'm fine.


00:46:39.512 --> 00:46:41.644
Hyde is locked up now.


00:46:41.887 --> 00:46:45.162
And I'm right here with you.


00:46:48.121 --> 00:46:49.541
I'm sorry.


00:46:55.974 --> 00:46:58.530
- Sawyer.
- Hanna.


00:47:03.448 --> 00:47:05.582
Anna Stee... Gray.


00:47:05.923 --> 00:47:10.207
Mrs. Gray, it's your boss's boss's boss.
Look out your window.


00:47:10.667 --> 00:47:13.812
I think you deserved
a break from all this.


00:47:13.847 --> 00:47:16.008
I'm taking you away for the weekend.


00:47:16.043 --> 00:47:19.448
Mrs. Jones has packed your bags.
It's in the trunk.


00:47:19.483 --> 00:47:23.558
Did she know? Do I get to know
where we are going this time?


00:47:23.593 --> 00:47:24.594
Yes babe.


00:47:24.781 --> 00:47:26.980
You won that auction.
Right as where gets


00:47:27.080 --> 00:47:29.486
- your money's worth.
- Okay I'm coming.


00:47:33.538 --> 00:47:36.494
- Nice to see you again, Statham.
- Mrs. Grey, Mr. Grey.


00:47:43.689 --> 00:47:45.071
- Surprise!
- Oh my God!


00:47:46.779 --> 00:47:49.181
You don't wanted to see
more of your friends?


00:48:18.212 --> 00:48:20.347
That's beautiful.


00:48:21.337 --> 00:48:25.005
You think this is nice?
You should see it in the snow.


00:48:25.040 --> 00:48:27.011
You should totally hit
the sauna together.


00:48:27.021 --> 00:48:28.268
Totally.


00:48:32.512 --> 00:48:35.892
